<view class="page"><view class="card"><view class="title">商品评价管理</view><view class="notice">{{cloudMode ? '云端真实评价；商家不能删评、改评分或自行审核回复。' : '本机演示不生成真实评价，请配置云端店铺。'}}</view><view wx:if="{{error}}" class="error">{{error}}</view><block wx:if="{{cloudMode}}"><input maxlength="36" value="{{productId}}" bindinput="productInput" placeholder="商品ID（留空查看全部）" disabled="{{busy}}"/><picker range="{{stars}}" value="{{rating || 0}}" bindchange="ratingChange" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="picker">{{stars[rating || 0]}} ›</view></picker><picker range="{{statusNames}}" value="{{statusIndex}}" bindchange="statusChange" disabled="{{busy}}"><view class="picker">{{statusNames[statusIndex]}} ›</view></picker><view>仅低分（1—2星） <switch checked="{{low}}" bindchange="lowChange" disabled="{{busy}}"/></view><button bindtap="refresh" disabled="{{busy || loading}}" loading="{{loading}}">查询／刷新评价</button><view wx:if="{{summary}}" class="summary">当前商品范围公开评价：{{summary.count}} 条 · 平均 {{summary.average === null ? '暂无' : summary.average}} 星<view class="notice">统计只使用已公开版本，不随候选评分筛选变化。</view><view wx:for="{{summary.distribution}}" wx:key="rating">{{item.rating}} 星：{{item.count}} 条</view></view><view wx:if="{{!loading && !rows.length}}">暂无匹配评价</view><block wx:for="{{rows}}" wx:key="id"><review-card row="{{item}}" bind:images="images"/><view>审核：{{item.statusText}} · 回复：{{item.replyStatusText}}</view><view class="notice">商品ID：{{item.productId}}</view><view wx:if="{{item.publicRating}}" class="notice">公开版本：{{item.publicRating}} 星 · {{item.publicContent}}</view><button size="mini" data-product="{{item.productId}}" bindtap="filterProduct" disabled="{{busy}}">仅看此商品</button><button wx:if="{{!item.withdrawnAt}}" size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="reply" disabled="{{busy || pendingReply}}">回复／修改回复</button><button size="mini" data-id="{{item.id}}" bindtap="report" disabled="{{busy}}">举报至平台</button></block><button wx:if="{{hasMore}}" bindtap="more" disabled="{{loading}}">加载更多</button></block><view wx:if="{{replyId}}" class="form"><view>回复对象：{{replyTarget}}</view><view>当前回复候选；需平台审核后才公开，原公开回复保留至新版本通过。</view><textarea maxlength="500" value="{{replyText}}" bindinput="replyInput" disabled="{{busy || pendingReply}}" placeholder="回复最多500字"/><button type="primary" bindtap="submitReply" disabled="{{busy || !replyText}}" loading="{{busy}}">{{pendingReply ? '原编号重试回复' : '提交回复审核'}}</button><button bindtap="cancelReply" disabled="{{busy}}">关闭／核对回复结果</button></view><view wx:if="{{reportId}}" class="form"><textarea maxlength="500" value="{{reportReason}}" bindinput="reportInput" disabled="{{busy}}" placeholder="说明违规原因；举报不会自动删除或隐藏差评"/><button bindtap="submitReport" disabled="{{busy || !reportReason}}">提交举报</button><button bindtap="cancelReport" disabled="{{busy}}">取消</button></view></view></view>
